==Description==
'''Trophy Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[PVP Season 0]] as a reward for getting to Sergeant III rank.

==Appearance==
The '''Trophy Charm''' is a giant trophy. The color of the '''Trophy Charm''' depends on the color of the player's name in chat, but it is golden in its preview in the inventory.

==Update History==
*'''23 July 2025''' - [[v1.71.0]]
**'''Trophy Charm''' added.
*'''22 October 2025''' - [[v1.77.0|v1.77.5a]]
**'''Trophy Charm''' is no longer obtainable.



